\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The four channels, all four aggregators, under Mode~S}; endpoint change $\kappa {=}0 \to \kappa {=}2$. \textbf  {$\Delta $~agg.\ is the relative displacement of the aggregate the defense \emph  {emits}}, $\|\mathrm  {agg}(T(U)) - \mathrm  {agg}(U)\|/\|\mathrm  {agg}(U)\|$, so it is what enters training and \textbf  {not} the value of a scoring statistic. \textbf  {$\Delta $~adm.\ is the \emph  {support} of the admitted adversarial mass and $\Delta \Lambda _a$ is the separate influence question}, the weight the adversary's direction carries; the two are never interchangeable. Admission never moves in any measured round of any arm. The table does \textbf  {not} order the arms, $\Delta \Lambda _a$ and $\Delta $ASR disagreeing in rank. Per-row provenance, the round counts, and the emitter are in App.~\ref {app:channel_table}.}}{7}{table.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
